|---|--------------------|--------------|----------|
| 1 | 2 vs 1 (≠)         | 1            | 1        |
| 2 | 2 vs 2 (=)         | 2            | 2        |
| 3 | 2 vs 2 (=)         | 3            | 3        |
| 4 | 3 vs 2 (≠)         | 1            | 3        |
| 5 | 3 vs 3 (=)         | 2            | 3        |
| 6 | 4 vs 3 (≠)         | 1            | 3        |

Returns **3**, matching the expected result (the three `2`'s).

